WEBVTT

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.530
Hey, Hanabishi-kun!

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.040
Hey, can I have a little time?

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.040
Professor Itsuki.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.170
How is it?

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.540
Have you started seeing your future yet?

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:52.710
Eh!

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.880
It's good you're diligent in helping me with papers, though.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.620
But you need to move forward to ensure your future.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.610
Yes.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:05.460
Well, I'll try to help you as much as I can.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.020
Thank you very much.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.630
Do your best.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.400
I'm expecting a lot from you.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:12.690
Yes.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.430
Oh, no, no.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.970
I didn't call you here to say that.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.030
I ended up giving you a lecture.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:20.780
Here.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:23.970
This is...

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:26.910
I got it from someone I know.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.000
You're always helping me out,
so this is my way of saying thanks.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.790
Go take your girlfriend.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.940
Wow!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.570
It feels nice, doesn't it, Kaoru-sama?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:57.240
Yeah.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.780
I'm so happy we could
go out, just the two of us.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.410
The timing was good, wasn't it?

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.720
With Aoi-sama?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.780
U-Um...

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.500
Well, that should be fine.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:27.440
Tina-san is on a photography
trip with her friends from college.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.650
Taeko-san and Chika-san
are {putting things away}helping at the see house.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.060
Aoi-sama does seem a bit bored right now.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.550
Then, tomorrow...

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.800
Kaoru-dono.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:40.950
Y-Yes?

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:45.620
Please be sure to take good care of Aoi-sama.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.660
Good care.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.670
Y-Yes.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.090
Wow! So wonderful!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:26.940
This is Chinatown, right?

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.870
This is my first time here!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.700
Actually, it's my first time here, too.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.120
Which reminds me, I'm kind of hungry now.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.150
So am I.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:39.170
We've come all this way,
so we need to enjoy Chinatown.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.840
Yes!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.130
Even though I said that,
an expensive place would be...

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.010
Kaoru-sama.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:47.550
Heh!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.630
Ah, w-what, Aoi-chan?

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:53.020
I want to eat that.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:53.520
Hm?!

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.040
Chinese buns?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.150
Yes!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.360
Wow, it's so big!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.350
Really.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:09.350
There's no way I could eat this entire thing.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.740
Kaoru-sama, let's eat it together.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.580
Heh, ah, but...

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.620
I want to eat it together.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.420
OK.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.050
Here you are.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:31.510
It's delicious.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:40.050
Next time we come, I would like to let Aoi-chan eat lots of delicious food.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.030
You need to move forward to ensure your future.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.240
My future, huh?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.130
Huh?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.840
What could it be?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.270
Maybe filming something for a TV show?

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:04.260
Shall we go take a look?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:04.980
Yes!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.900
A wedding ceremony, huh?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.900
Beautiful!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:31.240
I'm sure Aoi-chan will look really
beautiful in her wedding gown.

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:42.420
I wonder if I'll really be able
to make Aoi-chan happy?

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:49.340
Just like that, to get the blessings of so many people!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.800
Sorry to keep you.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.190
Oh, welcome back.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.450
Here you are, Kaoru-sama.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.680
Thanks.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:13.710
Huh?

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.240
Aren't you going to eat one?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.560
Ah, um...

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.180
Well..

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.880
If it's all right, I was thinking we
could share the soft serve, too.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.410
I see.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.510
Let's hurry back!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.320
Yeah.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.960
We were around that age when we met, Aoi-chan.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.010
Eh!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:42.400
You've been thinking of me
the whole time since then, right?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:46.610
Kaoru-sama.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:47.570
Ah!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:55.780
Continuing to think of only one
person requires a lot of courage.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.090
Eh!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:05.760
It made me worried about what I would do if the one I loved grew to hate me.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:12.970
Such feelings always, always continued every day.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.270
During those times,

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:25.690
I got rid of all of my other feelings

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:30.480
and filled myself up with the feelings I had for you.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:37.700
When I did that, I thought I'm able to think about Kaoru-sama this much.

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.860
I'm able to love Kaoru-sama this much.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:51.210
I'm very happy just being
able to love you, Kaoru-sama.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.890
That's why I was...

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:03.390
always and ever able to
think about you wholeheartedly.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.520
Kaoru-sama.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.900
From now on, for ever...

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:13.400
Please let me love you for ever.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.290
Aoi-chan.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.670
Kaoru-sama.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:30.420
Should we stay here for tonight?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.960
Eh!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:23.510
Should we stay here for tonight?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.480
W-What should I do?

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:32.400
Would staying the night be all right?

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.320
But staying the night means...

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.650
Sorry to keep you, Aoi-chan.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.360
Ah!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:41.250
I just checked us in.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.490
Y-Yes!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.580
Um, good work!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.080
Eh!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.410
I'm sorry.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.540
Eh?!

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.460
For saying something like this all of a sudden.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.840
N-No.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.460
I'm all right with it.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.360
I got these tickets from Professor Itsuki.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.510
I wasn't sure what to do with them, but...

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:11.150
I still want to spend more time alone with you, so...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.310
Kaoru-sama.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.940
Wow.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.530
This room's more amazing than I thought it'd be.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.330
Kaoru-sama, look.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.040
It's so pretty.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.340
Yes.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.680
I can't believe this food came with the room.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.020
It looks delicious.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.310
Yeah. Well, let's eat.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.530
Yes, {thank you for the food}itadakimasu.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.940
Ah, that's...

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.440
Eh!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.430
That's a clock, isn't it?

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:01.800
Yeah, it is.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:04.460
I thought it was a normal Ferris wheel.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.230
There isn't anything that doesn't change, is there?

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.500
Eh!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.150
This time right now only exists here.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.680
Tomorrow, a different time will be moving.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.050
The Sakuraba house is that way, too.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.460
Everyone lives under the same roof.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.730
And are always together.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.020
Every day is enjoyable.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.570
But someday, that will end.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:40.870
It's sad, though.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:45.780
But, I believe that I have to accept that.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.780
Aoi-chan.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.670
It was delicious.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.220
Yes, thank you for the food.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.630
All right, then.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.090
Aoi-chan, wait here a moment.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.260
Kaoru-sama, where are you going?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.180
Well, I'll go to make a quick call to Miyabi-san.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.370
Oh, no!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.730
I completely forgot to contact Miyabi-san.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:19.410
I was thinking of contacting her after dinner.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:22.140
Ah, in that case, I will...

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:22.940
It's okay.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:23.530
Eh!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.240
I'm the one who invited you, so I'll talk to her.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:28.810
Kaoru-sama.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.120
Okay, I'll be back soon.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.060
Miyabi-san, I'm sorry.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:41.090
I had so much fun, I just...

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.080
I wonder if Kaoru-sama will be all right.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.010
If he says we're staying the night...

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.310
Spending the night is completely unacceptable!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.430
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.810
Kaoru-sama's really late.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.360
I'm sure Miyabi-san got angry at him.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:24.900
I'd like to gaze at this skyline with
Kaoru-sama a bit more before we go home.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.370
I'd like him to fawn on him a little more.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.340
I'm back. Ah...

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.530
Kaoru-sama!

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.990
W-What's wrong, Aoi-chan?

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.750
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.790
She got angry at you because of me, didn't she?

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.540
Eh?!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.190
It's my fault.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:48.360
I'm not properly taking care
of things and caused you problems.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.530
Aoi-chan.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.510
Yes?

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.620
I got permission, so...

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.280
Heh!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.270
Heh! R-Really, Kaoru-sama?

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.300
Yeah.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.910
I can't believe it.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.610
Miyabi-san...

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.520
She was against it, at first.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:15.520
I thought so.

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:18.750
But I talked to her.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:24.460
I understood. I give you
permission to spend the night out.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.460
Thank you very much, Miyabi-san.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.420
Please take care of Aoi-sama.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.530
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.070
Talked?

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:38.350
Yeah.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.180
We talked about you, Aoi-chan.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.310
Eh!

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.710
About me?

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:45.700
Yeah.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:56.570
When I think about my future the first thing I think of is where your happiness is.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:17:01.450
You, who have continued to think
of me since we were engaged.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:06.170
So, I've been thinking about
how I should return your feelings.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:10.170
About how I can make you happy, Aoi-chan.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.130
And I realized.

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:19.150
Your happiness isn't with the Hanabishis.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:20.920
Nor with the Sakurabas.

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:25.250
I realized that your happiness lies within me.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:28.560
I'm sure that you're inside of my happiness.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.830
And that I'm inside of your happiness, Aoi-chan.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:38.830
In that way, I believe that our happiness
is the two of us embracing each other.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.060
Kaoru-sama.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:45.470
That's why right now, in order to be able to support you, Aoi-chan,

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:49.750
I believe I, myself, have to do my best as I go on.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:59.290
To return your feeling who has always loved me ever since that you met me as my fiancée,

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:00.850
To be with you.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.750
To do my best.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.650
I wondered if that might be
how I could make you happy.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.440
Aoi-chan?

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.360
Kaoru-sama.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.810
You love me that much...

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:20.920
I'm so happy.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.410
Thank you so much.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.040
Thank you so much.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.680
Don't cry.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:33.310
Kaoru-sama.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:38.820
I love you.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.050
Kaoru-sama!

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.960
I love you, too.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.630
Aoi-chan!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:20.800
Tina?

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.600
Oh, Kaoru, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.350
I'm home!

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:26.810
What are you doing?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:29.980
Just what you see, roasting sweet potatoes.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.010
Ouch.

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:32.940
T-This is horrible!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.270
I-Is it a fire?

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.680
Huh?

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:37.860
Oh, welcome home!

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.240
Welcome home.

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.760
You both came home at a good time.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.260
What, what?

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:47.430
Huh, roasted sweet potatoes?

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.200
Yeah.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:53.170
Then it's only right for us
to roast our souvenirs, too.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:54.580
Yeah.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.460
Souvenirs?

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.210
Yes, cut and dried horse mackerel.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.640
Eh!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.640
Ah!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.580
Tae-chin!

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.130
With sweet potatoes?

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.710
Yes! They're delicious!

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.280
Huh? They're gone.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.350
They're gone!

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.600
Heh?

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.810
I'm sure they're at the bottom.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:12.980
I-It's horrible!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:13.440
Ah!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.400
I-It's a fire!

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.090
Ah!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:23.950
Marshmallows are delicious
when they're lightly toasted.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:27.140
This bonfire is for sweet potatoes only!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.910
Then what about those dried horse mackerel?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.770
Eh... T-Those are...

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:34.080
See, Mayu wins.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.790
It's filled with potatoes and
mackerel! They won't fit!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.590
Would you mind not
saying such childish things?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.850
I'm not a child!

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:45.220
And marshmallows are
definitely better untoasted!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.640
They're tasty when they are toasted!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:54.440
Oh, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, the brat is picking on me!

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:57.690
Everyone, shall I make some tea?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.090
Yay!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.090
Yeah.

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:38.210
Aoi Onee-san, what
are we studying today?

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.790
Japanese hot springs.

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.540
Yay, hot springs, hot springs!

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:46.290
Hot spring spas use warm
subterranean mineral water...

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:49.790
and the steam created is
maintained at higher than 25 C.

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:54.180
Um, the next time in Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi is Bathrobe.

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:56.140
Kaoru-kun, are you listening?

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:56.930
Y-Yes!

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:58.180
Then, I'll continue.

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:01.060
Among the many types,
several have a specific purpose...
